(USB live modes) Tj
T*
(Normal live mode mounts ISO and rootfs read-only. It uses a cleared temporary overlay) Tj
T*
(on OOONANA_PERSIST when available on the same boot USB, with RAM fallback.) Tj
T*
(Persistent live mode accepts only an ext4 OOONANA_PERSIST partition on the same) Tj
T*
(physical boot USB. Its full writable overlay saves files, settings, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth) Tj
T*
(pairings, packages, and system changes.) Tj
T*
(Other disks may be probed read-only. Live mode writes only to matching boot USB) Tj
T*
(persistence. Only the confirmed installer target can be partitioned or formatted.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(First boot) Tj
T*
(ooonana setup --first-boot --gui can create user, set password, write network config,) Tj
T*
(choose theme, set zram and disk-swap policy, add cloud repo, and mark setup complete.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WSL) Tj
T*
(Import full-i3 with scripts/install-wsl-distro.sh --distro Ooonana --tarball) Tj
T*
(/var/tmp/ooonana-os/release/ooonana-full-i3-wsl-rootfs.tar.gz --force) Tj
T*
(Launch nested full desktop with: wsl.exe -d Ooonana -- /usr/bin/start-ooonana-i3) Tj
T*
(--nested) Tj
T*
(WSL GUI needs WSLg and Xephyr, or an X server with DISPLAY set. Nested mode keeps i3) Tj
T*
(panel and dock together in one window.) Tj
T*
(Update an imported distro with: ooonana update && ooonana upgrade) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(AI) Tj
T*
(Ooonana AI runs as ooonana ai ... or ooonana-ai. It supports cloud providers, offline) Tj
T*
(Intel OpenVINO, ask/chat, tools, tasks, audit, history, status, and a native GUI.) Tj
T*
(The full-i3 desktop includes a ChatGPT-style AI workspace, Settings, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth,) Tj
T*
(Packages, and Spotlight-style application launcher.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Desktop and hardware) Tj
T*
(The i3 desktop uses solid graphite and orange styling, rounded controls, a top) Tj
T*
(music/window bar, and a centered opaque dock with running dots, click-to-restore apps,) Tj
T*
(and right-click window actions.) Tj
T*
(Ctrl+Shift+Esc opens native Task Manager with processes, performance, and available) Tj
T*
(temperature and fan sensors. Unavailable hardware counters are labeled, not guessed.) Tj
T*
(Live USB starts compressed zram swap. OpenVINO setup requires persistent USB storage) Tj
T*
(or an installed system; RAM-only live storage cannot hold its runtime and models.) Tj
T*
(Ooonana OpenVINO Chat 0.2.0 has a browser GUI through an authenticated loopback) Tj
T*
(bridge. Windows-only computer-control tools are unavailable on Linux.) Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi supports personal and enterprise profiles. NetworkManager, BlueZ, D-Bus, Intel) Tj
T*
(Wi-Fi/Bluetooth firmware, Chromium, Python 3, sudo, su, and doas are included in) Tj
T*
(full-i3.) Tj
T*
() Tj
